---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Refund Policy" description="Refund Policy for iptvsubscription.top: our 7-day money-back guarantee, when refunds apply, and how to request one.">
  <p>
    We want you to be happy with your subscription. This policy explains when refunds are
    available.
  </p>

  <h2>7-day money-back guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    Every plan is backed by a 7-day money-back guarantee. If the service does not work for you and we
    cannot fix the problem, you can ask for a refund within 7 days of your purchase.
  </p>

  <h2>Refund eligibility</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Your request is made within 7 days of purchase.
    </li>
    <li>
      You experienced a technical issue with the service that our support team could not resolve in
      a reasonable time.
    </li>
    <li>
      Refunds are not available after the 7-day period, or where the service was working on your
      device and the issue is caused by your own internet connection or equipment.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to request</h2>
  <p>
    Message us on WhatsApp or email {site.email} with your order details and a description of the issue. We'll work with you
    to fix the problem first, and process an eligible refund if we can't.
  </p>

  <h2>Processing</h2>
  <p>
    Approved refunds are returned to your original payment method. Processing times depend on your
    payment provider.
  </p>
</Legal>
